{"id":68351,"date":"2025-10-19T07:25:33","date_gmt":"2025-10-19T06:25:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68351"},"modified":"2026-09-28T20:26:45","modified_gmt":"2026-09-28T19:26:45","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-castelo-de-paiva","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-castelo-de-paiva\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Castelo de Paiva 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Castelo de Paiva 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Castelo de Paiva 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Largo do Conde<\/strong>, na freguesia de Sobrado, concelho de <strong>Castelo de Paiva<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. A prova \u00e9 coorganizada pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Castelo de Paiva<\/strong>, pelo <strong>Centro Sol Nascente<\/strong>, pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Aventuras do Paiva<\/strong>, pela <strong>ADC da C.J. Clarks<\/strong> e pelo <strong>GDC de Castelo de Paiva<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa noturno apresenta duas vertentes: a prova competitiva de <strong>Corrida 10 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s 19h15) e a <strong>Caminhada 5 km<\/strong> de cariz l\u00fadico (com in\u00edcio \u00e0s 19h20). O circuito percorre as principais art\u00e9rias iluminadas da vila, contando com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, abastecimento, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e pr\u00e9mios para os primeiros classificados gerais e por escal\u00f5es.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=